{"parents": [{"link": "../../", "title": "API Reference"}, {"link": "../", "title": "Auth0 Fastapi"}], "prev": {"link": "../stores/stateless_state_store/", "title": "Stateless State Store"}, "next": null, "title": "Util", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth0_fastapi.util\">\n<span id=\"util\"></span><h1>Util<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth0_fastapi.util\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<section id=\"functions\">\n<h2>Functions<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#functions\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.build_request_base_url\" title=\"auth0_fastapi.util.build_request_base_url\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">build_request_base_url</span></code></a>(\u2192 str)</p></td>\n<td><p>Build base URL from request headers.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.create_route_url\" title=\"auth0_fastapi.util.create_route_url\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">create_route_url</span></code></a>(\u2192 str)</p></td>\n<td><p>Ensures route URLs are created correctly by removing the leading slash from the</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.ensure_no_leading_slash\" title=\"auth0_fastapi.util.ensure_no_leading_slash\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ensure_no_leading_slash</span></code></a>(\u2192 str)</p></td>\n<td><p>Removes any leading slash from the given URL string.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.ensure_trailing_slash\" title=\"auth0_fastapi.util.ensure_trailing_slash\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ensure_trailing_slash</span></code></a>(\u2192 str)</p></td>\n<td><p>Ensures that the base URL ends with a slash.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.normalize_url\" title=\"auth0_fastapi.util.normalize_url\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">normalize_url</span></code></a>(\u2192 str)</p></td>\n<td><p>Normalize a URL or domain string for comparison.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.to_safe_redirect\" title=\"auth0_fastapi.util.to_safe_redirect\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">to_safe_redirect</span></code></a>(\u2192 Optional[str])</p></td>\n<td><p>Ensures that the redirect URL is safe to use by verifying that its origin matches</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"package-contents\">\n<h2>Package Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#package-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.util.build_request_base_url\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_fastapi.util.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">build_request_base_url</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">request</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">fastapi.Request</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../_modules/auth0_fastapi/util/#build_request_base_url\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.build_request_base_url\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Build base URL from request headers.\nSupports proxy headers (x-forwarded-host, x-forwarded-proto) for MCD scenarios.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>request</strong> \u2013 FastAPI Request object</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>//app.example.com\u201d)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>Base URL string (e.g., \u201chttps</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.util.create_route_url\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_fastapi.util.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">create_route_url</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">url</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">base</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../_modules/auth0_fastapi/util/#create_route_url\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.create_route_url\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Ensures route URLs are created correctly by removing the leading slash from the\nprovided URL and ensuring the base URL has a trailing slash. Then uses urljoin\nto combine them.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>url</strong> \u2013 The URL (or path) to use.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>base</strong> \u2013 The base URL to use.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>A complete URL string combining the base and url.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.util.ensure_no_leading_slash\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_fastapi.util.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ensure_no_leading_slash</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">url</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../_modules/auth0_fastapi/util/#ensure_no_leading_slash\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.ensure_no_leading_slash\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Removes any leading slash from the given URL string.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.util.ensure_trailing_slash\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_fastapi.util.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ensure_trailing_slash</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">base</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../_modules/auth0_fastapi/util/#ensure_trailing_slash\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.ensure_trailing_slash\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Ensures that the base URL ends with a slash.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.util.normalize_url\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_fastapi.util.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">normalize_url</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">value</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../_modules/auth0_fastapi/util/#normalize_url\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.normalize_url\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Normalize a URL or domain string for comparison.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>Normalized <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">https://&lt;host&gt;</span></code> string, or empty string if input\nis empty.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_fastapi.util.to_safe_redirect\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_fastapi.util.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">to_safe_redirect</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dangerous_redirect</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">safe_base_url</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../_modules/auth0_fastapi/util/#to_safe_redirect\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.to_safe_redirect\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Ensures that the redirect URL is safe to use by verifying that its origin matches\nthe origin of the safe_base_url.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>dangerous_redirect</strong> \u2013 The redirect URL to check.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>safe_base_url</strong> \u2013 The base URL to check against.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>A safe redirect URL string if the origins match, or None otherwise.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["reference/auth0_fastapi/stores/stateless_state_store/index", "Stateless State Store", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "reference/auth0_fastapi/util/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Util</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#functions\">Functions</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#package-contents\">Package Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.build_request_base_url\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">build_request_base_url()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.create_route_url\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">create_route_url()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.ensure_no_leading_slash\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ensure_no_leading_slash()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.ensure_trailing_slash\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ensure_trailing_slash()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.normalize_url\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">normalize_url()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_fastapi.util.to_safe_redirect\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">to_safe_redirect()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "reference/auth0_fastapi/util/index", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/ethical-ads.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html", "sidebar/variant-selector.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#f2f2f2", "foreground": "#1e1e1e"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}